<title>UK: Both Brent dates kept - trade.</title>
<headline>Both Brent dates kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both Brent crude oil cargoes which turned wet on Tuesday were kept before the five o' clock deadline by Esso and Vitol, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargoes are due to load in the May 21-23 loading window.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
